                    <dd>Family Characteristics (1963-2022)</dd>
                
            <dt>Public MeSH Note</dt><dd>2023; for STEPFAMILY and FAMILY, RECONSTITUTED see FAMILY 1996-2022; for MATRIARCHY and PATRIARCHY see FAMILY CHARACTERISTICS 1995-2022</dd>
        
